# Claude Code. The agents and commands are project tooling and belong to
# everyone working on this repo; everything else under .claude/ is local
# session state (and this directory was blanket-ignored during the
# secrets scrub, which caught them by accident rather than by intent).
.claude/*
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/commands/

# Mobile signing / service-account credentials - never commit these
*.p8
*.p12
*.jks
*.keystore
*.mobileprovision
play-service-account.json
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist
